  "name": "SELLC StakingRewards permissionless token listing and spot-priced sell",
  "summary": "StakingRewards.addLiquidity() lets anyone list any token, and sell(token, token1, amount) pays out any token1 the contract holds at the spot rate of the caller-controlled token/token1 pair. The attacker listed its own token, paired it with the contract's SELLC/QiQi LP and sold worthless tokens for that LP, then burned it and dumped the SELLC. Copycats repeated it.",
