  "notes": [
    "The anchor is the attacker's listing call (the defect's first use); its two sell transactions and the copycats follow. Copycats were found from every StakingRewards outflow: sell() calls with a token other than QiQi. Dust sells (under 10 SELLC) and copycats' own listing deposits are left out.",
    "LP valued at disposal: the anchor attacker's 20.71M LP at its realised WBNB (pro rata to victim SELLC, net of its own 33,690 SELLC), copycat LP at the SELLC share of pair reserves times DefiLlama's post-crash SELLC price. QiQi's only market was the drained pair and nobody sold it: no value."
